  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Western Area Gas Power Generation Project, through Solidaris, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study for CECA SL Generation Limited (Grantee), a privately-owned company in Sierra Leone, to develop an approximately 83.5 megawatt combined cycle gas power generation plant in Freetown, Sierra Leone (Project). When implemented, the Project will provide critical reliable and affordable energy to the people of Sierra Leone. The Grantee selected Princeton Energy Resources International as the sole-source contractor for the Study.</narrative>
  </description>
